<p>This Privacy Policy explains how {{DEVELOPER_NAME}} ("we", "us") collects, uses and shares information when you use the mobile game <strong>Bird Rush - Online Multiplayer</strong> (the "App"), available on Google Play. By using the App, you agree to this policy.</p>

<h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Game data:</strong> player nickname (if you choose one), scores, match results and leaderboard entries needed for online multiplayer.</li>
  <li><strong>Device and usage data:</strong> device model, operating system version, app version, IP address, crash logs and general usage statistics.</li>
  <li><strong>Advertising identifiers:</strong> the Android Advertising ID, used by Google AdMob to show and measure ads.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not collect your name, phone number, contacts, photos, or precise location.</p>

<h2>2. How we use information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To run online matches, save scores and display leaderboards.</li>
  <li>To show ads, including rewarded ads that let you continue a run.</li>
  <li>To fix crashes, improve performance and prevent cheating or abuse.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
<p>The App uses the following third-party services, which may collect information under their own privacy policies:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Google Play Services – <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
  <li>Google AdMob – <a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543">support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543</a></li>
  <li>Google Firebase (multiplayer, database, analytics, crash reporting) – <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy">firebase.google.com/support/privacy</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Advertising and your choices</h2>
<p>AdMob may show personalized ads based on your Advertising ID. You can reset your Advertising ID or opt out of personalized ads in your device settings under Google › Ads. Where required by law (for example in the EEA and UK), we ask for your consent before showing personalized ads.</p>

<h2>5. Data sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal data. Information is shared only with the service providers listed above to operate the App, or when required by law.</p>

<h2>6. Data retention and deletion</h2>
<p>Game data is kept while your player profile is active. You can request deletion of your data at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> with the subject "Bird Rush data deletion". We will delete your data within 30 days.</p>

<h2>7. Security</h2>
<p>Data is transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS) and stored with Google Firebase. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, but we take reasonable measures to protect your information.</p>

<h2>8. Children</h2>
<p>The App is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

<h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

